    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but you dont get it. it's not just \"feeling\" bad. when i see their families, i feel like an intruder. like i'm just an empty shell occupying a spot that was meant for someone who actually deserved to live. it feels so fundamentally wrong to just... exist. like the universe made a mistake and i'm just living in a glitch.\n Singaporean or very casual formatting? be used if",
